<view class="screen"><view class="title">最近任务</view><view class="subtitle">转换结果暂存 24 小时，及时保存到微信。</view><view class="card" wx:if="{{!jobs.length}}"><view class="muted">还没有转换任务，返回首页选择一个工具开始吧。</view></view><view class="card" wx:for="{{jobs}}" wx:key="id"><view class="label">{{item.title}}</view><view class="muted">{{item.message}}</view><button class="secondary" wx:if="{{item.state === 'done'}}" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="openResult">查看或下载结果</button><button size="mini" wx:if="{{item.state !== 'queued' && item.state !== 'running'}}" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="deleteJob">删除文件与记录</button></view><view class="error" wx:if="{{error}}">{{error}}</view></view>
